 =?UTF-8?q?tch-net=20census=20(~10=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet open flight still paid lootShards._catchPodsInNets payloads+shipLike
isOutlawCatchNet / isJettisonedCargoPod census every tick while non-jettisoned
payloads existed but no nets and no flying pods. Quiet latch short-circuits
when both bags stay empty; wakes on membership, a live net/pod, or 0.5 s
rescan. Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Fresh lootShards residual after #145
customs cones.
---
 src/systems/lootShards.js                  |  75 ++++++++++++-
 test/catch-nets-empty-quiet-latch.test.mjs | 125 +++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 194 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 test/catch-nets-empty-quiet-latch.test.mjs

diff --git a/src/systems/lootShards.js b/src/systems/lootShards.js
